# Pairs with ColdLoadMeetsCoreStraddler (R -> C, #5839). The edge rests on two of R's properties
# together: the read-only cold load never lowers a generation a claim raised, and R guarantees
# StraddlerBelowInit. Either alone keeps a straddler of the purged incarnation out after reinit;
# with both weakened it is admitted.
MODULE: ColdLoadMeetsCoreStraddlerLowersReclaimedUnguarded
TARGET: ColdLoadMeetsCoreStraddler
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the cold load installs the floor whatever the durable row holds, and StraddlerBelowInit is dropped, so a straddler is admitted after reinit through the lowered entry

--- FIND
    /\ memFence' = [memFence EXCEPT ![i] = Max2(fence[i], retired[i])]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the cold load lowers a re-claimed generation to the floor.
    /\ memFence' = [memFence EXCEPT ![i] = retired[i]]
--- END

--- FIND
    /\ DeferredHeadAtRaisedGeneration
    /\ StraddlerBelowInit
    /\ BulkHintBound
--- REPLACE
    /\ DeferredHeadAtRaisedGeneration
    /\ BulkHintBound
--- END
